sequenceDiagram
  actor Customer
  participant UI as Flutter UI
  participant Server as Trusted command service
  participant DB as Firestore
  participant Worker as Notification worker
  Customer->>UI: Review approved quote and confirm
  UI->>Server: Command + request ID + expected version
  Server->>Server: Authenticate, authorize, validate approved policy
  Server->>DB: Transaction: availability, quote, order, audit, receipt, outbox
  DB-->>Server: Atomic commit
  Server-->>UI: Committed result reference
  UI-->>Customer: Confirmed order
  Worker->>DB: Read committed notification intent
  Worker-->>Customer: Best-effort FCM notification
  Note over UI,DB: Timeout requires receipt reconciliation before retry
  Note over Server,Worker: Notification failure does not undo committed order
